      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not a phase though. thats what everyone says to be nice, but it feels real. the reputation, the career, the way people talk about me... thats not a temp thing. it's permanent. it's like i've been deleted from the world. even if i try to \"move forward\" there's nothing to move toward. there's just this emptiness where my life used to be. how do you move forward when you don't even exist to anyone anymore?",
